},
```

In `ws.onmessage`, add `const drive = parseDrive(event.data); if (drive) { opts.onDrive?.(drive); return; }` before the existing gesture handling, and add `onDrive?: (drive: Drive) => void` to `LiveOptions`.

In `apps/web/src/sync/bus.ts`, extend the union:

```ts
/** A deck of this account's own pressing something; see the socket's `Drive`. */
| { t: "drive"; from: string; run: string; seq: number; ref: string; press: string; move?: string; answer?: Record<string, unknown> }
```

and have the sync engine's `onDrive` emit it on the bus.

